  37: /**
  38:  * This service is started by CarMediaService when a new user is unlocked. It connects to the
  39:  * media source provided by CarMediaService and calls prepare() on the active MediaSession.
  40:  * Additionally, CarMediaService can instruct this service to autoplay, in which case this service
  41:  * will attempt to play the source before stopping.
